%SIXMD 1
# @?RMDIR - REMOVE EMPTY DIRECTORIES

## DESCRIPTION

REMOVES EACH NAMED EMPTY DIRECTORY.

USAGE IS 'RMDIR DIR ...'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/RMDIR
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/RMDIR.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

